     stale-prune exists to prevent, and the only thing that ever caught it,
     `D1-verdicts.txt`, does not look at file NAMES.)

HOW MANY INSTRUMENTS NAME EACH ARTIFACT -- what decides constant vs contract:
  2 instrument(s) name   4 of 103
  3 instrument(s) name  46 of 103
  4 instrument(s) name  53 of 103
  => 103 of 103 are named by TWO OR MORE instruments, so a
     rename must move all of them at once or the pair silently stops agreeing.
